            "name": "Ranked ratings leaderboard.",
            "description": {
              "content": "Providers ranked by composite score, highest first. Filter by band, score range, trend, or a facet threshold (`facet` + `min_facet`), and scope to providers or tags. Each entry carries rank, composite, band, trend, and the six facet scores.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
